# Mutation plan for `FileWillBeDownloaded` on the four read routes (docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md, Phase 5).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-hooks-downloads.plan
#
# The oracle is `parity::plugin_hooks::the_download_hook_fires_as_go_fires_it`.
#
# Not mutated: the thirty-second budget and its translated message (the tour has no plugin that
# sleeps, since a test that waits thirty seconds is a bug), the `file_download_rejected` event
# (the tour holds no websocket), the first page's server-locale translation (`en` on both sides),
# and stopping at the first refusal (the tour has one plugin). The last two lines are the no-op
# controls and must SURVIVE.

